  "statement": "Solve $\\dfrac{dy}{dx}=3y$ given $y(0)=1$.",
  "solution": "Separating variables: $\\dfrac{dy}{y}=3dx$, so $\\ln|y|=3x+C$ and $y=Ae^{3x}$. With $y(0)=1$, $A=1$, hence $y=e^{3x}$.",
